 stored in your tables and returns a result set in the form of a datasheet, without changing the data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="360146">select query</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="588906">Mai zaɓen sakamako</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14528_276550_1996332"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A single location in Windows where you can adjust mobile PC settings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="276550">Windows Mobility Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1996332">Cibiyar Saita Kwamfutar Tafiya na Windows</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14534_21247_587083"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file that contains encoded information that is interpreted according to the application that created it. In general, a binary file can be edited only by the application in which it was created.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="21247">binary file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="587083">Fayil na bainari</term><termNote type="geographicalUs