ural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1862108">Zane-zanen bi bango</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15449_261564_588337"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool used to edit the content of web pages that the customer has created with Office Live.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="261564">Page Editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="588337">Mai gyara shafi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15452_219611_587238"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of data that is organized and summarized into a multidimensional structure that is defined by a set of dimensions and measures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="219611">OLAP cube</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="587238">Tarin bayanin ƙusurwar hagu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15452_41272_587238"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of data that is orga