at appears behind the content of a visual element, for example, behind the text that is displayed in a TextBox control or on your graphical user interface.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="658956">background</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2086184">bayanbango</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1943_494725_1453165"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A control designed to contain content such as placeholder or sample text or images that is updated by the user, or pre-defined lists of items from which users can select.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="494725">content control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1453165">Kulawar ƙunshin bayanai</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1944_321903_1335010"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to an operation or feature that involves moving objects on the screen with a mouse, a similar input device or a eventually a finger.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="321903">drag-and-drop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termG