 a simple and efficient way to utilize resources for an organization. The user account that is associated with a resource mailbox is disabled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="741964">resource mailbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2295153">maadani akwatin sako</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20675_743746_1527728"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To monitor an email conversation or newsgroup thread. The headers for messages in a watched conversation appear in a different color, which makes them easier to find in a message list.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="743746">watch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1527728">kalla</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20683_745706_1334203"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option on the Views menu in File Explorer that shows the most appropriate details for the file type in a flexible layout rather than only showing the details associated with the column headers in the view.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="745706">Content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1334203">Kumshin Bayanai</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20683_745706_1545940"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option on the Views menu in File Explorer that shows the most appropriate details for the file type in a flexible layout rather than only showing the details associated with the column headers in the view.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="745706">Content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1545940">Ƙunshin Bayanai</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20689_2356132_2359907"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Control Panel that provides the user with a single point of entry for tasks and notifications related to security and general PC software maintenance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2356132">Security and Maintenance</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359907">Tsaro da Aikin kula</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20695_746372_1334205"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A gallery that allows users to create a quick rule to move mail to a selected folder based on the sender, recipients, or conversation of the currently selected email message without opening the full Create Rule dialog.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="746372">Always Move gallery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1334205">Galarin Matsar da Sakwanni</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20697_777440_1488821"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of computers on a home network that can share pictures, music, videos, documents, and printers. A homegroup is created by using the HomeGroup feature; it is protected with a password.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="777440">homegroup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1488821">HomGuruf</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20698_782774_1488824"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A password that helps prevent unauthorized access to homegroup files and printers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="782774">homegroup password</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1488824">Kalmar sirri ta HomGuruf</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20702_746417_1334208"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A digital or paper format pack that usually consists of a proof of purchase, the description of the licensing terms and policies, and number of client access licenses (CALs) purchased in this pack.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="746417">CAL pack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1334208">Kundin CAL</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20703_746420_1334209"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An action that removes redundant messages from an email conversation to reduce information overload and improve readability.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="746420">Clean Up</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1334209">Rage cunkoson sakwanni</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNot