ar</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22564_1086975_1862512"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that automates the task of positioning images and combining them with text in documents. It produces attractive, editable designs that highlight photos and accompanying text and make it easy for novices to produce compelling, high quality photo layouts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1086975">SmartArt Picture Layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1862512">Shimfidar hoto na zanen SmartArt</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22564_1086975_1862515"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that automates the task of positioning images and combining them with text in documents. It produces attractive, editable designs that highlight photos and accompanying text and make it easy for novices to produce compelling, high quality photo layouts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1086975">SmartArt Picture Layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1862515">Shimfidar Hoton SmartArt</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2257_183896_1333953"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><des