e-defined table style that allows users to change the look and feel of a form.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1074773">layout style</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1453268">sakon shifiɗa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23349_1074775_1453269"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows form designers to select from a gallery of pre-built rules to make their forms dynamic.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1074775">Quick Rules</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1453269">Dokokin Sauri</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23351_1074778_1453270"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pre-defined layout that users can select for their InfoPath form sections. Options include single column, two-column, three-column, and four-column layouts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1074778">section layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1453270">shinfiɗar zaɓi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Nou