 list that provides an easy way to send messages to a group of people. A public group can include any item from a global address list, including other public groups.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1167275">public group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1862543">rukuni na kowa da kowa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25064_1167283_2294672"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A voice message that's played to callers to let them know that the person they called is away for an extended period of time and unavailable to answer the phone. It can be customized by the user. It's different from the voice mail greeting that's played when the recipient is away for a short period of time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1167283">away greeting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2294672">gaisuwar nesa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25074_1190063_1862564"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An add-in for Microsoft Excel that you can build with any compiler that supports building DLLs (dynamic link libraries).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1190063">XLL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNot