velop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1484852">SharePoint Deployment Planning Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2728490">SPDS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28405_1484852_2728491"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of services designed to help evaluate organizations' environments, develop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1484852">SharePoint Deployment Planning Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2728491">Aiyukan Tsara Kason SharePoint</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28405_1673938_2728490"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of services designed to help evaluate organizations' environments, develop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1673938">SDPS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></