hat backs up the entire computer (OS, settings, and files).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="323598">Complete PC Backup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1335075">Cikakkiyar ajiyar tsimi ta PC</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3644_116003_587724"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A statistical measure of the amount by which a set of values differs from the arithmetical mean, equal to the square root of the mean of the differences' squares.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="116003">standard deviation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="587724">Alamar ƙididdigar lissafi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3655_85228_587562"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A hyphen that is used to prevent a hyphenated word, number, or phrase from breaking if it falls at the end of a line.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="85228">nonbreaking hyphen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="587562">Dogon layi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="part