rip type="definition">The navigation layout that presents content in a single column on the page and that allows user to navigate from top to bottom.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244486">Vertical</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2256610">Tsaye</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38602_2244487_2256599"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Structure that places content along the horizontal axis and allows users to navigate through it from left and right.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244487">Panorama</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2256599">panorama</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38603_2244846_2256586"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway feature that allows a user to click on an embedded image to see any of the following: a high resolution version of it, a link to where the image was found, as well as related images.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244846">Detail view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp