i ko makaranta ɗinka</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="390_18288_1709411"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Referring to anything that is ready for immediate use by a user or application.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="18288">available</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1709411">samuwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39011_2321515_2325485"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Music, a highly personalized form of auto-playlist (rules-based playlist) that is created by Microsoft for the customer, drawing music from the customer's music collection, and, if the customer has an active music pass, may also include songs from our music catalog.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321515">mixtape</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325485">Keɓaɓɓen jerin waƙoƙi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39012_2268334_2270651"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Cellular data that customers can buy from the Windows Store to connect to their Windows device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2268334">paid cellular data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2270651">bayanan salula na biya</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39013_2268335_2270647"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Wi-Fi data or cellular data network that customers can connect to by buying minutes from the Windows Store.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2268335">paid data network</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2270647">hanyar sadarwar bayanai na biya</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39015_2268349_2270649"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An area in the Music app where recently played songs/albums and service-generated mixes are aggregated.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2268349">quick play</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2270649">saurin kaɗawa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammati