 particular business and process needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316274">line-of-business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322558">SK</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39878_2316275_2322557"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of, pertaining to, or characteristic of apps or services made available in an enterprise to help with particular business and process needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316275">LOB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322557">sashen-kasuwanci</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39878_2316275_2322558"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of, pertaining to, or characteristic of apps or services made available in an enterprise to help with particular business and process needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316275">LOB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322558">SK</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39880_2320100_2325483"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for PC and Surface Hub that helps you connect a phone or PC to the Surface Hub display, or to another PC. On Surface Hub, it also allows you to switch between devices that are connected to the Surface Hub.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2320100">Connect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325483">Mai umurta bayyana allo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39881_2320112_2325486"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mode in which the UI on the screen slides downward so that the user can reach items that normally would be near the top of the screen with one hand.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2320112">one-handed use</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325486">Amfani da hannu ɗaya</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39882_2320437_2322562"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for purchasing cellular data that is packaged with cellular enabled Dell devices that include a Microsoft SIM card.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2320437">Dell NetReady</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322562">Dell NetReady</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39889_2321509_2325490"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of TV shows that are in the top N% of ratings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321509">Top-rated TV shows</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325490">Shirye-shiryen TV mafi sama</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39890_2321510_2325484"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of items emphasized to the customer through placement on the site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321510">Featured collections</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325484">Fitattun taro-taro</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39891_2321511_2325488"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To make your search results more relevant by excluding unwanted and extraneous items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321511">refine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325488">tace</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39892_2321518_2325487"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows customers to temporarily connect to available free Wi-Fi hotspots in order to find and buy Wi-Fi services from the Windows Store.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321518">paid Wi-Fi services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325487">sabis-sabis na Wi-Fi na biya</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39932_2323787_2334707"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To create a sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2323787">sway</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334707">yi sway</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39933_2323799_2331071"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that lets users link their inbox for one email account with an inbox for another account, so they can see the messages from both accounts in a single place.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2323799">Linked Inboxes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331071">Kafaffen cikin Akwati</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39934_2323812_2331070"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The OneNote toolbar designed to help individuals with learning differences or who are looking for literacy assistance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2323812">Learning Tools for OneNote</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331070">Kayan Koyo na OneNote</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39935_2324831_2328062"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To install an operating system image on a device, reformatting all partitions as part of the process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324831">flash</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328062">girka hoton tsarin kwamfuta</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="400_236964_1334945"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature of Windows Vista that gives the user quick access to useful information on their computer, such as calendar appointments and the latest email message even when the computer is in standby mode or hibernating, media playback control when the computer is off, and other application notifications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="236964">auxiliary display</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1334945">Mai iso ga bayanai cikin sauri</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40026_2326216_2331069"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Exchange Online Protection that delivers an email without its attachments, scans the attachments for viruses, and then reattaches the attachments to the mail in the inbox.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2326216">Dynamic Email Delivery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331069">Isar da Sako mai Sauyawa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40027_2326225_2334822"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that allows users to collect Word, PowerPoint, Excel, Office Mix, and PDF documents as well as sways and publish them on the website, docs.com, where others can view, download or share them or comment on them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2326225">Docs.com</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334822">Docs.com</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40031_2338749_2339776"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The standalone 3D scanning app available in the Windows Store.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2338749">3D Scan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2339776">3D Scan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40032_2328169_2329049"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature of the 3D Scanner app that allows users to take 3D selfies.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328169">3D Selfie</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329049">Hoton kanka na 3D</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40033_2328170_2328364"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A 3D printing format that allows design applications to send 3D models to other applications, platforms, services, and printers.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328170">3MF</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328364">3MF</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40034_2328171_2329050"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The rectangular boundaries of the object to be scanned.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328171">boundary cube</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329050">Iyaka ta muka'abi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40035_2328172_2329052"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that simulates a body scanning booth by using a turntable in combination with the Kinect.​​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328172">scanning booth</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329052">rumfar sikani</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40036_2328173_2329053"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A circular revolving platform where you can place an object for 3D scanning.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328173">turntable</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329053">dandamali mai juyawa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40037_2328194_2329051"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The multi-app package for Windows 10 that includes the Messaging app for SMS, instant messaging, and Skype chat, and the Skype video app for VoIP video and audio calling.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328194">Messaging + Skype</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329051">Aika saƙo da Skype</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40039_2329141_2334012"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To add a previously banned person to a contact list again, so a user can receive calls or instant messages from the person.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329141">unblock</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334012">cire toshewa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40040_2329142_2334011"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Text message sent to an electronic device to notify the receiver of something because the receiver has requested notification or accepted an offer to be notified about something.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329142">SMS alert</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334011">faɗakarwar SMS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40041_2329143_2334010"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Skype call hosted by one user where lots of other users can join and participate in</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329143">Skypecast</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334010">Skypecast</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40043_2329145_2334008"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An application that can be installed on any mobile or landline in any supported country. It provides users with numbers that let them call friends, family and colleagues abroad from any mobile or landline while avoiding international calling charges.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329145">Skype to Go</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334008">Skype don Zuwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40044_2329146_2334007"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A web-based meeting scheduling and management tool. With Skype for Business Web Scheduler, you can create new meetings, change your existing meetings, and send invitations using your favorite email program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329146">Skype for Business Web Scheduler</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><t