ent that gives a user a view of the important email, as presorted by the Focused Inbox feature.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2333642">Focused</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340758">Muhimmi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40163_2333645_2340760"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The email management approach developed by productivity expert Merlin Mann so that zero time is spent thinking about email without any of the five actions he identified.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2333645">Inbox Zero</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340760">Sifiri Ciki Akwati</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4017_397157_2294791"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A storage platform that provides a single repository for managing multiple types of unstructured information in one infrastructure. The Exchange store combines the features and functionality of the file system, the Web, and a collaboration server (such as Microsoft Exchange) through a single, URL-addressable location for storing, accessing, and managing information, as well as building and running applications. The Exchange store is also known as the Web Storage System.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397157">Exchange store</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2294791">Sauyawa ma’adana</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40220_2338748_2340527"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service designed to provide single sign-on for browser, apps, and services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2338748">Web Account Manager</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340527">Manajan Asusun Yanar-gizo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40224_2339657_2340525"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app ​that lets you edit a song, so you can save part of it as a ringtone.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2339657">Ringtone Maker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340525">Mai ƙera Sautin kiran waya</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular