f formats and procedures that enable computers to exchange information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="95643">protocol</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1709952">furotukol</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40502_2353112_2353884"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that consumers can use to send feedback to the Windows team, to check for responses to that feedback, and to get news about the latest updates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353112">Windows Feedback Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353884">Dandalin Martani</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40502_2353112_2353886"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that consumers can use to send feedback to the Windows team, to check for responses to that feedback, and to get news about the latest updates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353112">Windows Feedback Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353886">Dandalin Martani na Windows</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40502_2353113_2353884"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that consumers can use to send feedback to the Windows team, to check for responses to that feedback, and to get news about the latest updates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353113">Feedback Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353884">Dandalin Martani</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40502_2353113_2353886"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that consumers can use to send feedback to the Windows team, to check for responses to that feedback, and to get news about the latest updates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353113">Feedback Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353886">Dandalin Martani na Windows</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40503_2353114_2353882"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of settings that admins can use to manage files and operating system settings on enterprise-owned devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353114">enterprise control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353882">sarrafawar kamfani</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40504_2353123_2353885"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The modern implementation of Windows PowerShell built on .NET Core. It includes a command-line shell, scripting language, and automation engine, providing IT administrators comprehensive control and automation of system administration tasks across multiple platforms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353123">PowerShell Core</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353885">PowerShell Core</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4053_11478_587024"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A keyboard key that is used in conjunction with another key to produce some special feature or function and is typically marked with the letters Alt.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="11478">ALT key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="587024">Maɓallin joni</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40537_2354519_2357420"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The phone app that helps customers transfer content from their Android phone to their Windows 10 Mobile phone. There are 2 instances of the app, one that you install on Android, and one that you install on Windows (phone only).​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354519">Move to Windows</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357420">Gushe zuwa Windows</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40541_2354632_2687163"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A statistical measure of the reliability of an estimate, which calculates the margin of error.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354632">confidence</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2687163">ƙwarin gwiwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4055_21561_1709440"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The smallest unit of information handled by a computer or device. One bit expresses a 1 or a 0 in a binary numeral, or a true or false logical condition. A group of 8 bits makes up a byte, which can represent many types of information, such as a letter of the alphabet, a decimal digit, or other character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="21561">bit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1709440">bit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4055_21562_1709440"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The smallest unit of information handled by a computer or device. One bit expresses a 1 or a 0 in a binary numeral, or a true or false logical condition. A group of 8 bits makes up a byte, which can represent many types of information, such as a letter of the alphabet, a decimal digit, or other character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="21562">binary digit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1709440">bit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4059_124417_1862096"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file (or component within another file) that contains Automation standard descriptions of exposed objects, properties, and methods.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><ter