ch as travel reservations and package deliveries captured from email and receive reminders for them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2435055">Events from Email</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2438530">Sha'anin Imel</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42991_2436154_2440019"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A cloud service that uses machine learning.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436154">intelligent service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2440019">Aikin tara bayanai</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42992_2436155_2440022"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Word Mobile feature that opens a preview window of the scrolling destination page when the user taps on the Thumb Scroll and that only updates the main view once the user lets go.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436155">Scroll Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2440022">Fara duba jirgawa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote typ