nProviderAttribute attribute in the source code. This method provides data to consumer controls in the form of an interface instance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="95667">provider</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1548142">mai samarwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5444_144872_1862159"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An animated border that appears around a worksheet range that has been cut or copied. To cancel a moving border, press ESC.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="144872">moving border</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1862159">iyaka mai tafiya</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5452_25722_1335153"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A unit of memory measurement that consists of eight bits.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="25722">byte</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1335153">bayit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termN