h that the shapes can be moved and resized as a unit.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141181">drawing canvas</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="587905">Yatsan zane</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6239_264786_588406"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view for delivering a presentation that provides the presenter with additional options for viewing and controlling its delivery.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="264786">Presenter View</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="588406">Majigin allon kwamfuta</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6240_30724_1335180"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of payment card where the supplier is paid by the card issuer. The card holder then pays the card issuer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="30724">credit card</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1335180">Katin amsar kudi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</t