r of a creative work, such as a text, a piece of music, a painting, or a computer program, through law.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="39968">copyright</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="587233">Haƙƙin mallaka</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7603_148245_1862184"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The visual representation of a script on a Web page that you open in a Microsoft Office program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="148245">script anchor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1862184">mabudin shafin rubutu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NGA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7604_137569_1862107"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In an organization chart, a shape that is placed below and connected to any other shape with an elbow connector. This shape is placed above any additional subordinate shapes for the particular superior shape it is attached to.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="137569">assistant shape</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ha-Latn-NG"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1862107">dan fasali mataimaki</term><termNote t